# Measurement output stays local, all of it.
#
# Recordings contain PHOTOGRAPHS OF WHEREVER THE CAMERA WAS POINTED, so the
# whole directory is excluded rather than a list of patterns: an earlier
# pattern list (data/*.csv, data/*_frames/) did not match
# data/run_<timestamp>/frames/, and a run would have been committed.
#
# Published results live in docs/figures/ and docs/FIELD_TEST.md, which are
# reviewed by hand before they go in.
data/

# Snapshots written by the UI's `s` key
focus_ui_*.png

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
